<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Qualitative comparison on AGIBOT-World dataset with text instruction “grasp the lower pant leg and waistband of denim shorts and fold them over the upper pant leg and waistband”. Here we sample six frames from the generated long video sequences for better presentation.</figcaption>
